                "id": 1770281213662.722,
                "type": "text",
                "value": "Frequency response 20Hz~40kHz\n\nInputs \n12 Ch Hi-Level / 2-Ch RCA HD Bluetooth/ Optical / Coaxial/ USB (DAC) [Hi-Level Input 30Vpp]\n\nOutputs \n10 Ch Hi-Level\n2 Ch RCA \n10W max x 1CH~6CH\n50W max x 7CH~10CH\n200W max x 11ch~12ch(2Ω)\nSampling Rate : 48kHz/24Bit\n\nSound & Tuning \n31-Band Parametric or Graphic EQ HPF /LPF / Bandpass Crossover per channel Software PC\nMatrix input summing\n\nDimension 263mm x 262mm x 58mm"
